WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.009
Skyler: I can't believe it's almost Christmas.

2
00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:23.028
Chatter: Merry Christmas! Happy New Year!

3
00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:25.225
Theo: I have a surprise.

4
00:00:25.226 --> 00:00:33.365
I taught Whiskers a trick.

5
00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.793
Riley: Wow. That's amazing!

6
00:00:36.794 --> 00:00:39.026
Ben: I have a surprise too.

7
00:00:39.027 --> 00:00:41.122
Riley: What is it?

8
00:00:41.123 --> 00:00:44.219
Ben: The Pet Lovers Club has a job.

9
00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.803
A snake-sitting job!

10
00:00:47.804 --> 00:00:52.840
Sarah: You mean we have to sit on a snake?

11
00:00:52.841 --> 00:01:00.972
Theo: No. Ben means we have a job taking care of a snake.

12
00:01:00.973 --> 00:01:02.381
Ben: That's right!

13
00:01:02.382 --> 00:01:04.843
Riley: Whose snake is it?

14
00:01:04.844 --> 00:01:07.528
Ben: It's Johnny Lee's snake, Sammy.

15
00:01:07.529 --> 00:01:10.530
Johnny lives next door to me.

16
00:01:10.531 --> 00:01:14.087
Ben: His family is going away for Christmas.

17
00:01:14.088 --> 00:01:18.124
Ben: We have to feed Sammy every day for five days.

18
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.022
Theo: Snake-sitting sounds fun!

19
00:01:21.023 --> 00:01:23.739
Ben: Yep. And you'll like Sammy.

20
00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:29.255
He's very friendly.

21
00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:32.189
Theo: This is my big sister Kelli.

22
00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.981
My mom said she had to come along.

23
00:01:34.982 --> 00:01:36.993
Kids: Hi, Kelli.

24
00:01:36.994 --> 00:01:39.914
Sarah: Are you baby-sitting us?

25
00:01:39.915 --> 00:01:42.239
Kelli: Well, kind of.

26
00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.202
But don't let that snake get near me!

27
00:01:45.203 --> 00:01:47.255
Theo: He won't get near you.

28
00:01:47.256 --> 00:01:49.251
Unless he gets out!

29
00:01:49.252 --> 00:01:51.825
Kelli: He'd better not, or I'm telling Mom!

30
00:01:51.826 --> 00:02:01.051
Theo: Don't worry. I'm just kidding.

31
00:02:01.052 --> 00:02:02.927
Ben: This is where Sammy lives.

32
00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:05.111
I'm going to show him to Speedy.

33
00:02:05.112 --> 00:02:10.508
Sarah: Speedy wants to run away!

34
00:02:10.509 --> 00:02:14.081
Riley: Maybe Speedy doesn't like snakes.

35
00:02:14.082 --> 00:02:18.112
Kelli: He's not the only one.

36
00:02:18.113 --> 00:02:20.051
Skyler: What does Sammy like to eat?

37
00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:23.984
Ben: Snake food from the pet store.

38
00:02:23.985 --> 00:02:27.238
Theo: I bet it has worms in it!

39
00:02:27.239 --> 00:02:30.763
Sarah: I'm glad I don't have to eat worms.

40
00:02:30.764 --> 00:02:35.111
Skyler: Look, Sammy's tongue came out.

41
00:02:35.112 --> 00:02:41.054
Theo: Maybe he's hungry!
